A.3 Verification of Communication Degree Condition for the Archimedes Swarm

For the Archimedes swarm with n = 500 tiles and packet success rate p_{\text{succ}} = 0.9, the stricter bound requires

\mathbb{E}[\deg(\Omega)] > \frac{2}{0.9} \ln 500 \approx 13.8.
