· Paraffin‑wax phase‑change material (20 cm³, 0.05 kg per pad) encapsulated in copper foam, with a melting point of 318 K, latent heat of fusion ∼200 kJ kg⁻¹, and total thermal capacity ∼10 kJ per pad.

