Hollow channels integrated into the CFRP frame (total internal volume ∼7 L) are filled on‑orbit with circulating water from the habitat thermal loop, providing approximately 10 g cm⁻² effective shielding. Quick‑connect fittings at each docking face enable water distribution through the RAFTI network after pressure‑shell completion.

